      "segments": [
        {
          "conclusion_ids": [
            "added_yin_exile"
          ],
          "event_id": null,
          "event_relation": null,
          "event_text": null,
          "text": "周胤受封以后，因罪被迁到庐陵郡。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entities": [
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7e20-b640-068fd30eb1f8",
          "importance": "primary"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7327-a124-6cf62ab06252",
          "importance": "other"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-73ab-8325-ebd48d7c40fe",
          "importance": "other"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7ef3-b965-c0e95db339f7",
          "importance": "other"
        }
      ],
      "id": "para_yin_petition",
      "phase_id": "p_yin_petition",
      "segments": [
        {
          "conclusion_ids": [
            "conclusion_033",
            "added_yin_loss"
          ],
          "event_id": "01a09988-8a05-7990-a67c-fe196127903f",
          "event_relation": "current",
          "event_text": null,
          "text": "赤乌二年，诸葛瑾、步骘联名上疏，请孙权顾念周瑜冒矢石、击败曹操和曹仁的功劳，宽免周胤，恢复兵权与爵位。他们援引汉高祖封爵誓言，主张功臣后裔也应得到照顾。孙权答复说并未忘记周瑜，只因周胤屡经告诫仍不改过，暂不愿立即恢复；奏疏则称周胤已经“降为匹夫”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entities": [
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7e20-b640-068fd30eb1f8",
          "importance": "primary"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7327-a124-6cf62ab06252",
          "importance": "other"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-73ab-8325-ebd48d7c40fe",
          "importance": "other"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7a05-8613-b2816e94df05",
          "importance": "other"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7454-8816-ae1d72268a04",
          "importance": "other"
        }
      ],
      "id": "para_yin_end",
      "phase_id": "p_yin_end",
      "segments": [
        {
          "conclusion_ids": [
            "added_yin_end"
          ],
          "event_id": "01a09988-8a05-7990-a67c-fe196127903f",
          "event_relation": "current",
          "event_text": null,
          "text": "诸葛瑾、步骘接连上表，朱然和全琮也一同为周胤求情，孙权终于答应，可周胤恰在这时病死。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entities": [
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-7d6c-bf60-903744aa5e9f",
          "importance": "primary"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a04-71a3-b62d-ac6fb3673ba3",
          "importance": "other"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "01a09988-8a05-743e-9ce8-79c5a3e52055",
          "importance": "other"
        }
      ],
      "id": "para_jun",
